  "body": "## What's new in v2.5.25-dev.11-alpha2\n\n- image hooks: the Qt interface is what they finalise, not the Electron app\n- kiosk: no start clip, the screen opens on the interface\n- security: the paths, the error bodies and the blur index that CodeQL flagged\n- flasher: dependencies past the advisories\n- the Electron kiosk goes: nothing builds it, ships it or lists it any more\n- library editor: a streamed track says it comes from a streaming service\n- library editor: tags are written into every common format, WMA included\n- companion: the new Osmium Sound icon\n",
